  "contract": "#781, #823, #846 report these three passives as unimplemented; each is a set of native auras. Blightcap Ingestion (560282): two aura 178 MOD_DEBUFF_RESISTANCE, BasePoints 29 DieSides 1 (+30), misc 4 (poison) and 3 (disease); the resist roll in Unit::MagicSpellHitResult is statistical and the harness has no deterministic resist metric, so only the applied aura effects are asserted. Fury of Anub'Rekhan (800894): three aura 132 MOD_INCREASE_ENERGY_PERCENT, BasePoints 9 DieSides 1 (+10), misc 0 mana, 1 rage, 3 energy; it has PASSIVE (Attributes 448 includes 64) and DurationIndex 0, so Aura::CalcMaxDuration makes it permanent, and the aura is asserted first. Reinforced Exoskeleton (706002): aura 133 MOD_INCREASE_HEALTH_PERCENT and aura 49 MOD_DODGE_PERCENT, BasePoints 2 DieSides 1 (+3 each). Each metric is compared with the same actor's baseline taken before the spell is learned."
